menu "quiesink board"

    config QUIESINK_PIN_D8
        int "XIAO D8 GPIO (EE02 SCLK)"
        default 7
        range 0 48
        help
            Arduino D8 alias used by Seeed_GFX for the EE02 SPI clock.

    config QUIESINK_PIN_D10
        int "XIAO D10 GPIO (EE02 MOSI)"
        default 9
        range 0 48
        help
            Arduino D10 alias used by Seeed_GFX for the EE02 SPI MOSI line.

endmenu
